<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Aug real retail sales rise 8.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech Aug real retail sales rise 8.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech August retail sales, in real terms, rose 8.7 percent compared with the same month in 1995, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The CSU also said that total internal trade rose by 10.9 percent year-on-year in real terms in August.  </p>
<p> CZECH REAL RETAIL SALES    AUG 96  JULY 96  AUG 95  JAN-AUG 96</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr	    +8.7    +5.7    +4.2     +8.1</p>
<p>CZECH REAL INTERNAL TRADE</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	    +10.9   +12.1     n/a     +11.1</p>
<p>Note: All figures are preliminary. Total internal trade includes retail sales plus sales and repairs of motor cars, motor fuel, restaurant services and accommodation.  </p>
<p>The CSU also gave the following real retail sales data (percentage change year-on-year):</p>
<p>				    AUG 96  JULY 96  AUG 95  JAN-AUG 96</p>
<p>sales, repairs of motor</p>
<p>  vehicles plus motor fuel  +26.4    +36.0    n/a     +26.0</p>
<p>restaurants and</p>
<p>  accommodation		  -2.5    +11.2    n/a	+7.3</p>
<p>TRANSPORT</p>
<p>  total			   +19.5    +22.6    +5.9    +16.1</p>
<p>  railways			 -8.3    +11.9   -19.8     +3.5</p>
<p>  road transport		 +8.4    +11.0   +31.8    +12.8</p>
<p>  river			   -47.8    -46.8   -11.6    -28.3</p>
<p>  air				-5.0     -3.7   +26.3     -0.3</p>
<p>parallel and support</p>
<p>  activities		    +59.6    +50.9   -30.5     +37.1</p>
<p>-- Prague newsroom (42 2) 24 23 0003</p>
</text>
